 ## License
 
 [MIT](LICENSE.md)
+
+## Per-authorization scopes (local extension)
+
+`client.signIn.atproto({ handle, callbackURL, scope })` accepts an optional scope
+string. Omitting it requests only `atproto`, even if client metadata declares more
+permissions. The OAuth SDK validates explicit requests against that metadata.
+Linked-account scope metadata records the actual provider grant; inspect the
+restored OAuth session before authorizing resource operations.
